cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DepRisk in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DepRisk: Risk-aware, uncertainty-driven prioritization and verified remediation of dependency vulnerabilities"
abstract: >-
  DepRisk is a command-line framework that prioritizes and plans the safe
  remediation of software dependency vulnerabilities using reachability
  analysis, dependency hypergraphs, uncertainty modeling, and decision
  optimization, with a formally verified plan checker and a tamper-evident
  audit log.
authors:
  - family-names: Kabiri
    given-names: Jahed
    affiliation: "Tabriz University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/codeoops-dev/deprisk"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - dependency security
  - software supply chain
  - vulnerability management
  - reachability analysis
  - decision optimization
  - formal verification
  - SBOM
